{"type":"Film","id":"FR2017_078","slug":"fr2017-078-vive-la-crise","title":{"native":"Vive la crise !","english":""},"release":{"type":"Theatrical release","date":"2017-05-10","year":2017},"filmType":"Fiction film","directors":[{"id":"Jean-François Davy","slug":"jean-francois-davy","name":"Jean-François Davy","birthYear":1945,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[]}],"genre":["Comedy"],"media":{"posterUrl":"https://medias.unifrance.org/medias/54/166/173622/format_page/vive-la-crise.jpg","trailerUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6b2L1i4oRSA"},"synopsis":{"native":"Mai 2025 – Après de nouvelles élections, Rémi Fassola, devient le 9ème Président de la Cinquième République. C’est dans ce contexte qu’une quinzaine de personnages truculents et attachants, vont se croiser pour finalement se regrouper autour d’un agrégé de philo, réincarnation de Montaigne, qui vit dans la rue avec sa compagne Lola et va bientôt retrouver La Boétie, son ami depuis bientôt 5 siècles ! Et rencontrer Framboise, caissière d’un supermarché, qui va devenir sa fille adoptive… La troupe ainsi formée va trouver le bonheur du bien-vivre ensemble…","english":"May, 2025. Following elections, Rémi Fassola becomes the ninth president of the 5th Republic. It is against this backdrop that a dozen or so colorful and endearing characters cross paths and finally gather together around a philosophy professor, who is Montaigne reincarnated and lives in the streets with his partner Lola, and who will soon meet up with La Boétie, his friend of almost five centuries! He will also meet Framboise, a checkout assistant at a supermarket, whom he will adopt as his daughter. The little group that forms will discover the joys of living life to the full together…"},"production":[{"country":"France","share":"Majority coproducer"}],"characters":[{"id":"FR2017_078_01","film":"FR2017_078","person":{"id":"Jean-Claude Dreyfus","slug":"jean-claude-dreyfus","name":"Jean-Claude Dreyfus","bi